---
description: Zod schemas live in packages/shared and are the only input contracts.
globs: packages/shared/**/*.ts,apps/api/**/*.ts,apps/web/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Shared contracts

- Validate every input with Zod.
- Schemas and shared types live in `packages/shared`. Both apps import them.
- Do not copy a schema into `apps/web` or `apps/api`.
- Category colors come from the fixed palette exported by `packages/shared`, not a free-form hex value.

```ts
// BAD — a second copy inside the API
const createItemSchema = z.object({ type: z.enum(["link", "text"]) });

// GOOD — one schema, imported
import { createItemSchema } from "@revivenotes/shared";
```
